                    },
                    "locales": {
                        "en": {
                            "text": "<p>I’m a {{Full Stack &amp; AI Engineer}} based in Austin, Texas.</p><p>This site is my professional home and a public record of how I think: through systems, language, career decisions, technology, and the details of ordinary life.</p><p>I do not have polished project case studies ready to publish yet, so I’m showing the work I can stand behind today: [[clear thinking, careful reading, and consistent writing]].</p>"
                        },
                        "zh": {
                            "text": "<p>我是一名常驻美国奥斯汀的{{全栈与 AI 工程师}}。</p><p>这里既是我的职业主页，也是我公开记录思考方式的地方：系统、语言、职业选择、技术，以及普通生活中的细节。</p><p>我暂时还没有准备好公开的完整项目案例，因此先展示目前能够踏实呈现的成果：[[清晰的思考、仔细的阅读，以及持续的写作]]。</p>"
                        }
                    }
                }
